('127.98.d.25.E',3,'Exterior doors are commonly made of:','["Paper", "Cardboard", "Steel, fiberglass, or wood", "Foam only"]'::jsonb,2,'Durable materials are used.','original'),
('127.98.d.25.E',4,'A steel exterior door has a core of:','["Water", "Sand", "Paper only", "Insulating foam"]'::jsonb,3,'Foam improves R-value.','original'),
('127.98.d.25.F',3,'The vertical side members of a door frame are the:','["Jambs", "Mullions", "Sills", "Sashes"]'::jsonb,0,'Jambs surround the door.','original'),
