('127.98.d.29.D',3,'On a framing crew, which trait best shows leadership?','["Yelling when behind", "Keeping plans secret", "Treating crew members respectfully and fairly", "Taking credit for others'' work"]'::jsonb,2,'Respect builds a strong crew.','original'),
('127.98.d.29.D',4,'A crew lead who admits a measuring mistake and fixes it shows:','["Weakness", "Carelessness", "Poor planning only", "Honesty and accountability"]'::jsonb,3,'Owning errors earns trust.','original'),
